The wide-ranging (and often niche) hobby projects I've found time for, outside of my public-facing work on this site. As with everything else, feel free to <a href="mailto:me@cruzgodar.com">send me feedback</a> on any of them!

<div class="projects">
	<div class="project">
		<div class="section-text-with-image-link">
			<h2 class="section-text">Wilson: Applets Made Easy</h2>

			<a href="https://github.com/cruzgodar/wilson" class="image-link">
				<img src="/graphics/general-icons/placeholder.png" data-src="/projects/wilson/cover.webp" alt="Wilson" tabindex="1"></img>
			</a>
		</div>

		<div class="body-text-with-image-link">
			<p class="body-text">Wilson is the TypeScript and JavaScript library that powers <a href="/applets">every applet</a> on this site. It handles tasks like panning and zooming, makes parallelized GPU-based applets as easy as writing a shader, provides a robust and customizable fullscreen toolkit, and even lets you easily run 3D applets in a VR headset. All of this streamlines your work and simplifies your applets, letting you focus on the code that matters.</p>

			<a href="https://github.com/cruzgodar/wilson" class="image-link">
				<img src="/graphics/general-icons/placeholder.png" data-src="/projects/wilson/cover.webp" alt="Wilson" tabindex="1"></img>
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>

